{"id":"gak","title":"Global alignment kernel","family":"kernel","definition":"reference","intro_en":"The Global Alignment Kernel adds products of local similarities over all monotone alignment paths. The dynamic program uses a sum rather than choosing a minimum-cost predecessor. Here the local kernel is phi/(2-phi), with phi a Gaussian, following a sufficient positive-definiteness construction; the displayed result is unnormalized.","intro_zh":"全局对齐核将所有单调对齐路径上的局部相似度乘积相加。动态规划对前驱求和，不选择最低代价前驱。本例局部核为 phi/(2-phi)，其中 phi 是高斯核，对应一个充分的正定性构造；输出未做自相似归一化。","steps_en":["Build phi=exp(-squared_cost/(2*sigma^2)) with sigma=1, then kappa=phi/(2-phi).","Multiply each local kappa by the sum of its three predecessor path weights.","Accumulate every monotone alignment; do not replace the sum with a maximum or minimum.","Read the unnormalized path sum; optional self-normalization is a separate step."],"steps_zh":["用 sigma=1 构造 phi=exp(-平方代价/(2*sigma^2))，再令 kappa=phi/(2-phi)。","每个局部 kappa 乘以三个前驱路径权重之和。","累加全部单调对齐，不能将求和换成最大或最小值。","读取未归一化路径和；可选的自相似归一化是另一个步骤。"],"formula":"K_ij=kappa_ij*(K_(i-1,j)+K_(i,j-1)+K_(i-1,j-1)); kappa=phi/(2-phi), K_00=1","caveats_en":["An arbitrary local similarity or hard path restriction does not inherit the stated positive-definiteness construction.","Raw path sums depend strongly on sequence length and can overflow for long inputs; log-domain computation and self-normalization are distinct remedies."],"caveats_zh":["任意局部相似度或硬路径限制都不自动继承上述正定性构造。","原始路径和强烈依赖长度，长输入可能溢出；对数域计算和自相似归一化是不同处理方式。"],"sources":[{"label":"Cuturi (2011): local-kernel conditions for global alignment","url":"https://marcocuturi.net/Papers/cuturi11fast.pdf"},{"label":"EchoTime imported atlas: named formula conventions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"sigma":1.0,"local_kernel":"phi/(2-phi)","normalization":"none","hard_path_band":null,"epsilon":0.0,"raw_gak":3739.5094447576153},"result":{"label":"kernel score","value":3739.5094447576153,"detail":"The explicit definition and parameters shown on this card."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Convert local squared discrepancy using phi/(2-phi)","panel":{"kind":"matrix","title":"Modified Gaussian local similarities","z":[[0.9900744622116082,0.9900744622116082,0.9157041915106461,0.43526659839358384,0.02887790869493483,0.007516468846359594,0.05834134459661612,0.5003489933944892,1.0,0.7897042116712348],[0.9157041915106461,0.9900744622116082,0.9900744622116082,0.5700423818855314,0.04652955015961862,0.013233544344784166,0.08960619325974989,0.6429864916372999,0.9611663052891852,0.6429864916372999],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]],"row_label":"x index","col_label":"y index"}},{"phase":0,"caption":"Convert local squared discrepancy using phi/(2-phi)","panel":{"kind":"matrix","title":"Modified Gaussian local similarities","z":[[0.9900744622116082,0.9900744622116082,0.9157041915106461,0.43526659839358384,0.02887790869493483,0.007516468846359594,0.05834134459661612,0.5003489933944892,1.0,0.7897042116712348],[0.9157041915106461,0.9900744622116082,0.9900744622116082,0.5700423818855314,0.04652955015961862,0.013233544344784166,0.08960619325974989,0.6429864916372999,0.9611663052891852,0.6429864916372999],[0.43526659839358384,0.5700423818855311,0.7171364719909384,0.9900744622116082,0.1937821622278245,0.07257888349575384,0.3216606519831669,1.0,0.5003489933944892,0.23100490105279053],[0.036809513